{
  "summary": "This experiment tested an RNA-only model using the scgpt encoder, comparing it to the pca_n2000 encoder in a singleprofile setting. Validation accuracy of 0.4106 and F1 of 0.3785 suggest lower performance than the pca_n2000 baseline (0.4849 accuracy, 0.4639 F1), indicating potential limitations of the scgpt encoder in this context. The relative effectiveness of different RNA encoders remains uncertain without further comparative analysis."
}

